  "description": "This application seeks permission to construct a rear dormer \"pod\" room extension, attached to the existing dormer roof of the property. The proposed structure will extend over the rear flat roof, creating a dedicated walk-in wardrobe for the bedroom.\n\nThe pod room will have approximate dimensions of 3.2m x 2.7m, with its roofline positioned below the existing dormer roofline to ensure the height does not exceed the current structure. The extension will use materials, including tiles and window frames, that match the existing exterior. Any doors included will be fire-rated, ensuring both functionality and compliance.\n\nThe proposal includes a single inward-opening UPVC door, protected by railings, facing the applicant's garden. This design prioritizes the privacy of neighboring properties and minimizes any potential impact.",
